    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">BFS by levels</span><span class=\"chip accent\">DFS with depth</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/binary-tree-right-side-view/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 199</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Binary Tree Right Side View</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The node you see from the right is the LAST node of each level, not the end of the \"always go right\" path. BFS level by level and keep the last one, or DFS right-first and keep the first node met at each new depth. O(n) time, O(width) or O(height) space.</p>\n"
